  accept 94679                          -- Cedric Dalton

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip North up the road to the lumber camp. Halligan Turner runs it; his third job, the saplings, comes once his plant food is in.
  accept 94842                          -- Unsavory Plant Food
  accept 94931                          -- Stolen Saws

step The Bristle Hills
  tip West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp on the slopes all the way from the hills west of the lumber camp to the pass you came in by. The stolen saw blades lie only in the western camps, near the pass.
  tip Careful: Snargl, an elite gnoll (level 40), roams the south-western camps: pull the gnolls away from him.
