step Benjy Wheeler
  tip North-east across the fields to Wheeler's Grange: Benjy Wheeler wants the Mudfin murlocs on the river thinned out, the same murlocs whose heads Halligan needs, so one pass along the river does both.
  accept 94614                          -- Freshwater Fiends

step Meadowsbrook and the river
  tip Back south-west along the river: kill the Mudfin Warriors and Oracles on the banks for Benjy (they drop Halligan's heads) and the Jumbo Crawfish in the shallows for the shells. Curly, one of Halligan's lumberjacks, is stuck on the bank just north-west of the murlocs; Robbie's hat lies on the riverbank among them; the fresh manure is in the fields of Meadowsbrook, between the river and the farm. Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), prowls the river: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass.
  accept 94857                          -- Curly: If a Tree Falls, and No One Hears...
  kill 258574 x8 quest 94614.1          -- Mudfin Warrior
  kill 258573 x8 quest 94614.2          -- Mudfin Oracle
