step The Rog'mar training grounds
  tip North-east of Elbrim's farm, the Horde drills its trainees in the fields north of Rog'mar. Stay north of the fort: its guards are far above your level. The supply crates lie around the drill grounds. Three elites work this ground: Blademaster Kaijo (42) walks among the trainees, Krek the Noxious (42) lurks at the north end, and Komuk (45), a Horde elite, patrols the hills to the east; give each of them room.
  tip Careful: Rog'mar Grunts (55) guard the fort's north wall, around 59,39 to 61,41. Leave the crates and trainees by the wall and take the ones further north, around 57-61,34-37.
  kill 256749 x12 quest 95064.1 @60.8,37.0  -- Rog'mar Trainee
  collect 274975 x8 quest 95426.1       -- Rog'mar Supply Crate

step Blademaster Kaijo
  when group 95912
