step The crawlers and Trapclaw
  tip North along the beach from the docks: the crawlers drop the meat for Fimbo and the spittle for Zizplink, and their entrails count for Argo. Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the docks. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams this coast from the docks up to the pirates' camp: if you see him, keep well away.
  collect 268345 x6 quest 95121.2       -- Sand Crawler Meat
  collect 271650 x3 quest 95988.1       -- Crawler Spittle
  collect 268586 quest 95254.1          -- Trapclaw's Pincer

