step Train before the Badlands
  only !Shaman
  when !zone "Stormwind City"
  tip No class trainer stands in the Riverglades, and the Badlands & Hinterlands guide passes none: Gretchen Mayberry flies to Stormwind, where you train before you go on.
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Your class trainer
  only !Shaman
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  tip No class trainer stands in the Riverglades: train here in Stormwind before you fly on.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid

step Stormwind flight master
  only Shaman
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"

step Shaman trainer
  only Shaman
  tip No shaman trainer stands in the Riverglades or in Stormwind, and the Badlands & Hinterlands guide passes none: fly to Ironforge and train there; Thelsamar is a short flight on.
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge
  train class only Shaman

step Leave Stormwind
  when taxi "Thelsamar"
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The next guide starts in the Badlands, south of Loch Modan: fly to Thelsamar. Stormwind's gryphon master stands in the Trade District.
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Thelsamar"
  zone Loch Modan

step Loch Modan
  when !taxi "Thelsamar"
  when !zone "Loch Modan"
  zone Loch Modan
  tip No flight path to Thelsamar yet: go to Ironforge (by the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind), ride out of its gates east through Dun Morogh and the tunnel into Loch Modan, and on along the road to Thelsamar.
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Thelsamar"

step Fly to Thelsamar
  when taxi "Thelsamar"
  when !zone "Loch Modan"
  tip The next guide starts in the Badlands, south of Loch Modan: fly to Thelsamar.
  fly "Thelsamar"
  zone Loch Modan
